grail
------------------------------------------
Grail consists of an interface and tools for handling gesture recognition and
gesture instantiation.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libX11_6-1.8.13-1
  libXext6-1.3.7-1
  libXi6-1.8.3-1
  libframe6-2.5.0-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgrail-devel-3.1.1-1bl1
  libgrail6-3.1.1-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libX11-devel-1.8.13-1
  libXext-devel-1.3.7-1
  libXi-devel-1.8.3-1
  libframe-devel-2.5.0-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  xorgproto-2025.1-1

Canonical website:
  https://launchpad.net/grail

Canonical download:
  https://launchpad.net/grail/trunk/3.1.1/+download/grail-3.1.1.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack grail-3.1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./grail-3.1.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/grail-3.1.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/grail-3.1.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgrail6-3.1.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgrail-devel-3.1.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(grail)
  /usr/bin/grail-test-3-1.exe
  /usr/bin/grail-test-atomic.exe
  /usr/bin/grail-test-edge.exe
  /usr/bin/grail-test-propagation.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/grail.README
